        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Hanover Hound, Toy Trawler Spaniel, Bavarian Mountain Hound, Bavarian Hound\n- Concepts: dog breeds, extinct breeds, alternate names, crossbreeding\n\nFacts:\n- The Hanover Hound is a breed of dog that is sometimes referred to as a Hanoverian Hound.\n- The Toy Trawler Spaniel is an extinct breed of Spaniel.\n- The Toy Trawler Spaniel was physically similar to the King Charles Spaniel of the 16th century.\n- The Bavarian Mountain Hound is a cross between the Bavarian Hound and the Hanover Hound.",
